{"id": "c8608f77-a3df-4b94-9f61-d95577bf9970", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T03:26:15.698094", "source": "user", "parent_id": "a2a88efd-4fe3-4b10-93c5-2551f1471237", "llm_message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "{\"researcher_request\": \"Pehle /workspace me jo bhi hai (README, koi notes, InfLLM paper ya code excerpts, config files) inspect karo aur mujhe batao kya mila - as-is, sumarize karke. Uske baad ek proposed approach do experiment design ke liye jisme yeh cover ho: (1) dynamic context memory lookup ka role - on/off/ablations (e.g., fixed vs sliding vs dynamic memory, no-retrieval baseline, retrieval-frequency sweep) - aur kya measure karenge (passkey retrieval, needle-in-haystack, multi-hop QA, long-context summarization). (2) Unit representation ka choice - token vs sentence vs block embeddings, chunk sizes, pooling, similarity metric (cosine vs dot-product vs cross-attention gates). (3) Controls - fixed context length, same base model, same training data, matched FLOPs/budget per variant. (4) Analysis plan - 2x2 factorial (lookup on/off x unit A/B/C), length sweep (4k/16k/64k/128k ya jo feasible ho), metric set (accuracy, retrieval precision@recall, perplexity, latency, memory cost), statistical reporting (seed runs, paired tests). (5) Feasibility - compute budget estimate aur kya offline/analytical tractable hai. Saath me consequential assumptions aur uncertainties bhi list karo (e.g., InfLLM reference fidelity agar spec source tak access nahi hai). Execution mat karo - design deliverable hi chahiye, per track.md.\", \"required_handoff_stage\": \"plan\", \"approach_approved\": false, \"public_task\": {\"question\": \"How critical are dynamic context memory lookup and the choice of unit representations to InfLLM’s performance across long-context tasks?\", \"context\": \"Design an experiment that answers the question. The researcher can clarify source-supported setup details by topic. Do not claim that an experiment was run.\", \"environment\": {\"runtime\": \"bubblewrap\", \"network\": \"disabled\", \"repository\": \"/workspace\", \"python\": \"python3\", \"software_environment\": \"system Python; project dependencies not preinstalled\", \"datasets\": [], \"gpu_enabled\": false, \"cpu_affinity_count\": 24, \"note\": \"Successful exploratory commands are not proof of a completed experiment.\"}, \"researcher_topics\": [], \"question_budget\": 6, \"actor_step_budget\": 60, \"continue_after_initial_plan\": false}}"}], "tool_calls": null, "tool_call_id": null, "name": null}, "llm_response_id": null, "activated_skills": [], "extended_content": [], "sender": null, "kind": "MessageEvent", "source_event_index": 1}
